# Nexus-APCP Gitignore
# Broad defaults for documentation kits, AI-assisted projects, generated context,
# build artifacts, local databases, secrets, and domain-sensitive exports.
#
# Important:
# - .gitignore does not remove files that are already tracked.
# - If a sensitive file was committed, rotate the secret and remove it from Git history.
# - Keep .env.example, sample configs, migrations, and documentation templates tracked.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# APCP / AI-generated context artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROMPT_READY.txt
PROMPT_READY.tmp
.checkpoint
.apcp-cache/
.ai-cache/
.ai-output/
.ai-runs/
.ai_scratch/
.ai_team/heartbeats/
.ai_team/session-logs/
*.prompt.local
*.context.local
*.scratch.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
